inv_test_orch_synth	coastal_authority	Assess coastal infrastructure exposure in Dakshina Kannada	completed	{"plan_id": "plan_47fc2915", "workspace": "coastal_authority", "query": "Assess coastal infrastructure exposure in Dakshina Kannada", "normalized_intent": "coastal_vulnerability_assessment", "target_coordinates": {"latitude": 12.91, "longitude": 74.85, "radius_km": 150.0}, "target_time_horizon": "7-day numerical forecast + historical baseline", "steps": [{"step_id": "step_marine_hazard", "agent_id": "marine_hazard", "agent_name": "Marine Hazard & Forecast Agent", "phase": "specialist_concurrent", "dependencies": [], "description": "Ingest storm track, Douglas sea state wave spectra, and meteorological alerts.", "timeout_seconds": 20.0, "max_retries": 2}, {"step_id": "step_coastal_risk", "agent_id": "coastal_risk", "agent_name": "Coastal Impact & Risk Agent", "phase": "specialist_dependent", "dependencies": ["step_marine_hazard"], "description": "Evaluate coastal settlement and population exposure using upstream hazard wave and surge parameters.", "timeout_seconds": 20.0, "max_retries": 2}, {"step_id": "step_evidence_verification", "agent_id": "evidence_verification", "agent_name": "Evidence & Scientific Verification Agent", "phase": "scientific_auditor", "dependencies": ["step_marine_hazard", "step_coastal_risk"], "description": "Independently verify scientific claims, cryptographic SHA-256 evidence integrity, units, and detect cross-source conflicts.", "timeout_seconds": 25.0, "max_retries": 1}], "selected_agents": ["coastal_risk", "marine_hazard", "evidence_verification"], "verification_required": true, "created_at": "2026-10-18T02:11:59.610152Z"}	2026-10-18 07:42:02.707598+05:30	2026-10-18 00:11:57.884231+05:30	2026-10-18 07:42:02.714701+05:30	### Executive Intelligence Synthesis: Coastal Authority\n**Query:** Assess coastal infrastructure exposure in Dakshina Kannada\n\n#### 1. Operational Assessment & Decision Guidance\n- **Maritime Traffic & Port Clearance:** **🟢 NORMAL NAVIGATION / PORTS OPERATIONAL**\n- **Hydrodynamic Regime:** Calm wave regime (`0.68 m`). Coastal navigation channels open without draft restrictions.\n- **Actionable Directives & What to Do:**\n  1. New Mangalore Deep Port, Karwar Port, and Malpe Harbour operating at full commercial clearance.\n  2. Coastal infrastructure within 30km hazard buffer remains under zero-risk conditions.\n\n#### 2. Specialist Observations & Findings\n- **[Finding #1]** Estimated 624,301 residents across 5 coastal settlement(s) (Mangaluru City Corporation, Ullal Coastal Municipality, Surathkal Coastal Settlement, Padubidri Coastal Village and 1 others) fall within the hazard footprint. `624,301 people` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #2]** 2 maritime port/harbour facility(ies) intersect the hazard footprint: New Mangalore Port (NMPT), Old Mangalore Port (Bunder). `2 ports` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #3]** 1 apex healthcare facility(ies) located within the hazard zone: District Wenlock Hospital, Mangaluru. `1 facilities` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #4]** 1 critical ecological habitat(s) intersect the hazard zone: Netravati-Gurupura Estuarine Mangroves. `1 habitats` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #5]** Live ocean observation at (12.91°N, 74.85°E) records significant wave height of 0.68 m (swell height 0.56 m, wave period 9.0 s, wind wave 0.02 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n\n#### 3. Evidence Integrity & Cryptographic Provenance\n- **Total Evidence Records Ingested:** 10\n- **Primary Data Sources:** Open-Meteo Marine API, OpenStreetMap Contributors, Census of India & KSCZMA\n- **Sample Cryptographic Hash:** `d3a5cd0a81f1354b...` (SHA-256 Verified)\n\n#### 4. Scientific Verification Audit\n- **Audit Status:** `VERIFIED`\n- **Verified Claims:** 5 | **Cross-Source Conflicts:** 0 | **Unverified:** 0\n\n#### 5. Operational Safety & Limitations\n- Proximity or polygon intersection indicates potential exposure, but does not model hydrodynamic inundation depth or wave force without local bathymetry and DEM data.\n- Population figures reflect official Census counts and do not account for real-time transient, tourist, or floating populations.\n- **Official Warning:** *This assessment provides supplementary computational intelligence and does not replace official meteorological advisories from the India Meteorological Department (IMD) or INCOIS.*	{"notes": "Scientific verification run vrun_57e37cecf8: 5/5 claims matched, 37 checks passed.", "details": [{"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_test_orch_synth_1", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mangaluru", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ullal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_surathkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_padubidri", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mulki"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_test_orch_synth_2", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_port_nmpt", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_old_mangaluru"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_test_orch_synth_3", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_infra_wenlock_hospital"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_test_orch_synth_4", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_eco_netravati_mangroves"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_test_orch_synth_5", "missing_evidence_id