inv_15af2766	coastal-authority	Historical cyclone surge: simulate Extreme Cyclone Tauktae (5.8m waves) regional disaster inundation cone across entire 320km Karnataka coastline.	completed	{"plan_id": "plan_f723c061", "workspace": "coastal-authority", "query": "Historical cyclone surge: simulate Extreme Cyclone Tauktae (5.8m waves) regional disaster inundation cone across entire 320km Karnataka coastline.", "normalized_intent": "marine_hazard_tracking", "target_coordinates": {"latitude": 13.85, "longitude": 74.5, "radius_km": 160.0}, "target_time_horizon": "7-day numerical forecast + historical baseline", "steps": [{"step_id": "step_ocean_research", "agent_id": "ocean_research", "agent_name": "Ocean Intelligence & Research Agent", "phase": "specialist_concurrent", "dependencies": [], "description": "Analyze physical SST, thermal anomalies, currents, and biochemical chlorophyll-a spectra.", "timeout_seconds": 20.0, "max_retries": 2}, {"step_id": "step_marine_hazard", "agent_id": "marine_hazard", "agent_name": "Marine Hazard & Forecast Agent", "phase": "specialist_concurrent", "dependencies": [], "description": "Ingest storm track, Douglas sea state wave spectra, and meteorological alerts.", "timeout_seconds": 20.0, "max_retries": 2}, {"step_id": "step_coastal_risk", "agent_id": "coastal_risk", "agent_name": "Coastal Impact & Risk Agent", "phase": "specialist_dependent", "dependencies": ["step_marine_hazard"], "description": "Evaluate coastal settlement and population exposure using upstream hazard wave and surge parameters.", "timeout_seconds": 20.0, "max_retries": 2}, {"step_id": "step_evidence_verification", "agent_id": "evidence_verification", "agent_name": "Evidence & Scientific Verification Agent", "phase": "scientific_auditor", "dependencies": ["step_ocean_research", "step_marine_hazard", "step_coastal_risk"], "description": "Independently verify scientific claims, cryptographic SHA-256 evidence integrity, units, and detect cross-source conflicts.", "timeout_seconds": 25.0, "max_retries": 1}], "selected_agents": ["ocean_research", "coastal_risk", "marine_hazard", "evidence_verification"], "verification_required": true, "created_at": "2026-10-17T23:59:36.654536Z"}	2026-10-18 05:29:42.638182+05:30	2026-10-18 05:29:42.656229+05:30	2026-10-18 05:29:42.656229+05:30	### Executive Intelligence Synthesis: Coastal-Authority\n**Query:** Historical cyclone surge: simulate Extreme Cyclone Tauktae (5.8m waves) regional disaster inundation cone across entire 320km Karnataka coastline.\n\n#### 1. Specialist Observations & Findings\n- **[Finding #1]** Near-surface sea temperature model forecast off Karnataka °Coast across 168 forecast hours averages 30.11 °°C (range: 29.5 - 30.7 °°C across 168 forecast hours). `30.11 °C` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #2]** Wave model forecast off Karnataka °Coast across 168 forecast hours indicates mean significant wave height of 0.71 m (median: 0.72 m, range: 0.58 - 0.74 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #3]** Ocean current model forecast off Karnataka °Coast across 168 forecast hours indicates mean current velocity of 0.19 m/s (peak: 0.42 m/s). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #4]** Estimated 1,075,668 residents across 19 coastal settlement(s) (Mangaluru °City °Corporation, Ullal °Coastal Municipality, Surathkal °Coastal Settlement, Udupi °City Municipality and 15 others) fall within the hazard footprint. `1,075,668 people` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #5]** 9 maritime port/harbour facility(ies) intersect the hazard footprint: New Mangalore Port (NMPT), Old Mangalore Port (Bunder), Malpe Fishing Harbour, Bhatkal Fishing Port, Honnavar Port & Estuary Terminal, Tadadi °Commercial Fishing Port, Belekeri Natural Port, INS Kadamba / Karwar Naval Base (Project Seabird), Karwar °Commercial Port (Baithkol). `9 ports` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #6]** 3 apex healthcare facility(ies) located within the hazard zone: District Wenlock Hospital, Mangaluru, District Government Hospital, Udupi, District °Civil Hospital, Karwar. `3 facilities` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #7]** 5 critical ecological habitat(s) intersect the hazard zone: Netravati-Gurupura Estuarine Mangroves, St. Mary's Islands Geo-Heritage Site, Sharavati Estuary Mangrove Reserve, Aghanashini Estuary (Ramsar Wetland Site), Kali River Estuary & Mangrove Reserve. `5 habitats` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #8]** Live ocean observation at (13.85°N, 74.50°E) records significant wave height of 0.72 m (swell height 0.62 m, wave period 9.5 s, wind wave 0.02 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #9]** Historical precedent: Extremely Severe °Cyclonic Storm Tauktae (2021) produced peak observed waves of 5.8 m and gusts of 85 km/h, impacting Ullal, Mangaluru Bengre Spit, Malpe. *(Status: NEEDS_REVIEW)*\n- **[Finding #10]** Historical precedent: Very Severe °Cyclonic Storm Ockhi (2017) produced peak observed waves of 4.5 m and gusts of 65 km/h, impacting Mangaluru Bunder, Ullal, Someshwara. *(Status: NEEDS_REVIEW)*\n\n#### 2. Evidence Integrity & Cryptographic Provenance\n- **Total Evidence Records Ingested:** 40\n- **Primary Data Sources:** India Meteorological Department (IMD) & INCOIS, Open-Meteo Marine API, OpenStreetMap Contributors, Census of India & KSCZMA\n\n#### 3. Scientific Verification Audit\n- **Audit Status:** `VERIFIED`\n- **Verified Claims:** 8 | **Cross-Source Conflicts:** 2 | **Unverified:** 0\n\n#### 4. Operational Safety & Limitations\n- Shared marine database repository is not configured. Offline sample fixture was not substituted in production mode; current forecast was not substituted for missing historical data.\n- Surface wind variables are not provided by Open-Meteo Marine API (marine-api.open-meteo.com); requires atmospheric weather API.\n- Chlorophyll observations are unavailable through Open-Meteo Marine API.\n- Open-Meteo values represent numerical model forecasts and estimates rather than direct in-situ buoy/sensor measurements.\n- Proximity or polygon intersection indicates potential exposure, but does not model hydrodynamic inundation depth or wave force without local bathymetry and DEM data.\n- **Official Warning:** *This assessment provides supplementary computational intelligence and does not replace official meteorological advisories from the India Meteorological Department (IMD) or INCOIS.*	{"notes": "Scientific verification run vrun_c4c9752d60: 8/10 claims matched, 72 checks passed.", "details": [{"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-sst-7683a875", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-84e09005b4"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-wave-21e652c2", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-84e09005b4"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-current-0329da1c", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-84e09005b4"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_15af2766_1", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mangaluru", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ullal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_surathkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_udupi", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kundapura", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_padubidri", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kaup", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mulki", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_brahmavar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_maravanthe", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_byndoor", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_bhatkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_murudeshwar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ho