nd detect cross-source conflicts.", "timeout_seconds": 25.0, "max_retries": 1}], "selected_agents": ["coastal_risk", "marine_hazard", "ocean_research", "evidence_verification"], "verification_required": true, "created_at": "2026-10-18T00:51:00.084926Z"}	2026-10-18 06:21:05.883238+05:30	2026-10-18 06:21:05.912547+05:30	2026-10-18 06:21:05.912547+05:30	### Executive Intelligence Synthesis: Marine Monitoring\n**Query:** Analyze sea surface temperature, wave dynamics, and ocean currents off Karnataka Coastal Shelf across 7-day forecast horizon against ERA5 climatological baseline.\n\n#### 1. Specialist Observations & Findings\n- **[Finding #1]** Near-surface sea temperature model forecast off Karnataka °Coast across 168 forecast hours averages 30.17 °°C (range: 29.8 - 30.7 °°C across 168 forecast hours). `30.17 °C` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #2]** Wave model forecast off Karnataka °Coast across 168 forecast hours indicates mean significant wave height of 0.72 m (median: 0.74 m, range: 0.62 - 0.8 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #3]** Ocean current model forecast off Karnataka °Coast across 168 forecast hours indicates mean current velocity of 0.15 m/s (peak: 0.36 m/s). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #4]** Estimated 1,075,668 residents across 19 coastal settlement(s) (Mangaluru °City °Corporation, Ullal °Coastal Municipality, Surathkal °Coastal Settlement, Udupi °City Municipality and 15 others) fall within the hazard footprint. `1,075,668 people` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #5]** 9 maritime port/harbour facility(ies) intersect the hazard footprint: New Mangalore Port (NMPT), Old Mangalore Port (Bunder), Malpe Fishing Harbour, Bhatkal Fishing Port, Honnavar Port & Estuary Terminal, Tadadi °Commercial Fishing Port, Belekeri Natural Port, INS Kadamba / Karwar Naval Base (Project Seabird), Karwar °Commercial Port (Baithkol). `9 ports` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #6]** 3 apex healthcare facility(ies) located within the hazard zone: District Wenlock Hospital, Mangaluru, District Government Hospital, Udupi, District °Civil Hospital, Karwar. `3 facilities` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #7]** 5 critical ecological habitat(s) intersect the hazard zone: Netravati-Gurupura Estuarine Mangroves, St. Mary's Islands Geo-Heritage Site, Sharavati Estuary Mangrove Reserve, Aghanashini Estuary (Ramsar Wetland Site), Kali River Estuary & Mangrove Reserve. `5 habitats` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #8]** Live ocean observation at (13.85°N, 74.50°E) records significant wave height of 0.72 m (swell height 0.58 m, wave period 9.6 s, wind wave 0.02 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n\n#### 2. Evidence Integrity & Cryptographic Provenance\n- **Total Evidence Records Ingested:** 38\n- **Primary Data Sources:** Open-Meteo Marine API, OpenStreetMap Contributors, Census of India & KSCZMA\n\n#### 3. Scientific Verification Audit\n- **Audit Status:** `VERIFIED`\n- **Verified Claims:** 8 | **Cross-Source Conflicts:** 0 | **Unverified:** 0\n\n#### 4. Operational Safety & Limitations\n- Shared marine database repository is not configured. Offline sample fixture was not substituted in production mode; current forecast was not substituted for missing historical data.\n- Surface wind variables are not provided by Open-Meteo Marine API (marine-api.open-meteo.com); requires atmospheric weather API.\n- Chlorophyll observations are unavailable through Open-Meteo Marine API.\n- Open-Meteo values represent numerical model forecasts and estimates rather than direct in-situ buoy/sensor measurements.\n- Proximity or polygon intersection indicates potential exposure, but does not model hydrodynamic inundation depth or wave force without local bathymetry and DEM data.\n- **Official Warning:** *This assessment provides supplementary computational intelligence and does not replace official meteorological advisories from the India Meteorological Department (IMD) or INCOIS.*	{"notes": "Scientific verification run vrun_89e099c119: 8/8 claims matched, 60 checks passed.", "details": [{"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-sst-edbf83df", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-eeadfff74f"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-wave-8667b434", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-eeadfff74f"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-current-10877489", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-eeadfff74f"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_b7cb7466_1", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mangaluru", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ullal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_surathkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_udupi", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kundapura", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_padubidri", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kaup", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mulki", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_brahmavar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_maravanthe", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_byndoor", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_bhatkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_murudeshwar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_honnavar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kumta", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_gokarna", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ankola", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_karwar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_majali"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_b7cb7466_2", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids"