 wave 0.02 m). `0.7 m` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n\n#### 2. Evidence Integrity & Cryptographic Provenance\n- **Total Evidence Records Ingested:** 11\n- **Primary Data Sources:** Open-Meteo Marine API, OpenStreetMap Contributors, Census of India & KSCZMA\n\n#### 3. Scientific Verification Audit\n- **Audit Status:** `VERIFIED`\n- **Verified Claims:** 8 | **Cross-Source Conflicts:** 0 | **Unverified:** 0\n\n#### 4. Operational Safety & Limitations\n- Surface wind variables are not provided by Open-Meteo Marine API (marine-api.open-meteo.com); requires atmospheric weather API.\n- Chlorophyll observations are unavailable through Open-Meteo Marine API.\n- Open-Meteo values represent numerical model forecasts and estimates rather than direct in-situ buoy/sensor measurements.\n- Proximity or polygon intersection indicates potential exposure, but does not model hydrodynamic inundation depth or wave force without local bathymetry and DEM data.\n- Population figures reflect official Census counts and do not account for real-time transient, tourist, or floating populations.\n- **Official Warning:** *This assessment provides supplementary computational intelligence and does not replace official meteorological advisories from the India Meteorological Department (IMD) or INCOIS.*	{"notes": "Scientific verification run vrun_6372f66d60: 8/8 claims matched, 58 checks passed.", "details": [{"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-sst-85fa374b", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-d5a9fc74b8"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-wave-3fb7af8f", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-d5a9fc74b8"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source ev