and 1 others) fall within the hazard footprint. `624,301 people` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #5]** 2 maritime port/harbour facility(ies) intersect the hazard footprint: New Mangalore Port (NMPT), Old Mangalore Port (Bunder). `2 ports` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #6]** 1 apex healthcare facility(ies) located within the hazard zone: District Wenlock Hospital, Mangaluru. `1 facilities` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #7]** 1 critical ecological habitat(s) intersect the hazard zone: Netravati-Gurupura Estuarine Mangroves. `1 habitats` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #8]** Historical precedent: Extremely Severe Cyclonic Storm Tauktae (2021) produced peak observed waves of 5.8 m and gusts of 85 km/h, impacting Ullal, Mangaluru Bengre Spit, Malpe. *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #9]** Historical precedent: Very Severe Cyclonic Storm Ockhi (2017) produced peak observed waves of 4.5 m and gusts of 65 km/h, impacting Mangaluru Bunder, Ullal, Someshwara. *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n\n#### 3. Evidence Integrity & Cryptographic Provenance\n- **Total Evidence Records Ingested:** 12\n- **Primary Data Sources:** India Meteorological Department (IMD) & INCOIS, Open-Meteo Marine API, OpenStreetMap Contributors, Census of India & KSCZMA\n\n#### 4. Scientific Verification Audit\n- **Audit Status:** `VERIFIED`\n- **Verified Claims:** 9 | **Cross-Source Conflicts:** 0 | **Unverified:** 0\n\n#### 5. Operational Safety & Limitations\n- Surface wind variables are not provided by Open-Meteo Marine API (marine-api.open-meteo.com); requires atmospheric weather API.\n- Chlorophyll observations are unavailable through Open-Meteo Marine API.\n- Open-Meteo values represent numerical model forecasts and estimates rather than direct in-situ buoy/sensor measurements.\n- Proximity or polygon intersection indicates potential exposure, but does not model hydrodynamic inundation depth or wave force without local bathymetry and DEM data.\n- Population figures reflect official Census counts and do not account for real-time transient, tourist, or floating populations.\n- **Official Warning:** *This assessment provides supplementary computational intelligence and does not replace official meteorological advisories from the India Meteorological Department (IMD) or INCOIS.*	{"notes": "Scientific verification run vrun_6dcf838867: 9/9 claims matched, 65 checks passed.", "details": [{"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-sst-64ff507a", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-4228f8f8dc"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-wave-cc290c72", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-4228f8f8dc"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-current-fcaa5879", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-4228f8f8dc"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_7495b81e_1", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mangaluru", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ullal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_surathkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_padubidri", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mulki"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_7495b81e_2", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_port_nmpt", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_old_mangaluru"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified sou