.0, "max_retries": 1}], "selected_agents": ["coastal_risk", "marine_hazard", "ocean_research", "evidence_verification"], "verification_required": true, "created_at": "2026-10-18T06:30:51.122737Z"}	2026-10-18 12:00:53.492605+05:30	2026-10-18 12:00:53.509937+05:30	2026-10-18 12:00:53.509937+05:30	### Executive Intelligence Synthesis: Marine-Monitoring\n**Query:** Analyze near-surface sea temperatures, wave spectra, and ocean current velocity off the Karnataka coastline across 168 forecast hours.\n\n#### 1. Operational Assessment & Decision Guidance\n- **Oceanographic Assessment:** **🟢 PHYSICAL PARAMETERS STABLE ACROSS 168 FORECAST HOURS**\n- **Key Telemetry Metrics:** Mean wave height `0.69 m`, sea temperature `30.75 °C`, ocean current velocity `0.08 m/s`.\n- **Operational Guidance & What to Do:**\n  1. Open-Meteo telemetry stream validated with 100% cryptographic SHA-256 data consistency.\n  2. Continue automated 6-hourly cycle polling for Arabian Sea temperature drift.\n\n#### 2. Specialist Observations & Findings\n- **[Finding #1]** Near-surface sea temperature model forecast off Karnataka Coast across 168 forecast hours averages 30.75  °C (range: 30.6 - 31.0  °C across 168 forecast hours). `30.75 °C` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #2]** Wave model forecast off Karnataka Coast across 168 forecast hours indicates mean significant wave height of 0.69 m (median: 0.7 m, range: 0.54 - 0.78 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #3]** Ocean current model forecast off Karnataka Coast across 168 forecast hours indicates mean current velocity of 0.08 m/s (peak: 0.19 m/s). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #4]** Estimated 1,075,668 residents across 19 coastal settlement(s) (Mangaluru City Corporation, Ullal Coastal Municipality, Surathkal Coastal Settlement, Udupi City Municipality and 15 others) fall within the hazard footprint. `1,075,668 people` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #5]** 9 maritime port/harbour facility(ies) intersect the hazard footprint: New Mangalore Port (NMPT), Old Mangalore Port (Bunder), Malpe Fishing Harbour, Bhatkal Fishing Port, Honnavar Port & Estuary Terminal, Tadadi Commercial Fishing Port, Belekeri Natural Port, INS Kadamba / Karwar Naval Base (Project Seabird), Karwar Commercial Port (Baithkol). `9 ports` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #6]** 3 apex healthcare facility(ies) located within the hazard zone: District Wenlock Hospital, Mangaluru, District Government Hospital, Udupi, District Civil Hospital, Karwar. `3 facilities` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #7]** 5 critical ecological habitat(s) intersect the hazard zone: Netravati-Gurupura Estuarine Mangroves, St. Mary's Islands Geo-Heritage Site, Sharavati Estuary Mangrove Reserve, Aghanashini Estuary (Ramsar Wetland Site), Kali River Estuary & Mangrove Reserve. `5 habitats` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #8]** Live ocean observation at (13.85°N, 74.55°E) records significant wave height of 0.68 m (swell height 0.54 m, wave period 9.4 s, wind wave 0.00 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n\n#### 3. Evidence Integrity & Cryptographic Provenance\n- **Total Evidence Records Ingested:** 38\n- **Primary Data Sources:** Open-Meteo Marine API, OpenStreetMap Contributors, Census of India & KSCZMA\n\n#### 4. Scientific Verification Audit\n- **Audit Status:** `VERIFIED`\n- **Verified Claims:** 8 | **Cross-Source Conflicts:** 0 | **Unverified:** 0\n\n#### 5. Operational Safety & Limitations\n- Surface wind variables are not provided by Open-Meteo Marine API (marine-api.open-meteo.com); requires atmospheric weather API.\n- Chlorophyll observations are unavailable through Open-Meteo Marine API.\n- Open-Meteo values represent numerical model forecasts and estimates rather than direct in-situ buoy/sensor measurements.\n- Proximity or polygon intersection indicates potential exposure, but does not model hydrodynamic inundation depth or wave force without local bathymetry and DEM data.\n- Population figures reflect official Census counts and do not account for real-time transient, tourist, or floating populations.\n- **Official Warning:** *This assessment provides supplementary computational intelligence and does not replace official meteorological advisories from the India Meteorological Department (IMD) or INCOIS.*	{"notes": "Scientific verification run vrun_6afc608e9a: 8/8 claims matched, 60 checks passed.", "details": [{"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-sst-7d33fb10", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-f88a6aa126"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-wave-403e99bd", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-f88a6aa126"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-current-ccf8ee2b", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-f88a6aa126"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_90de5ebb_1", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mangaluru", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ullal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_surathkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_udupi", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kundapura", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_padubidri", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kaup", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mulki", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_brahmavar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_maravanthe", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_byndoor", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_bhatkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_murudeshwar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_honnavar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kumta", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_gokarna", "evi_cf_cf