inv_dd8174cf	marine-monitoring	Analyze near-surface sea temperatures, wave spectra, and ocean current velocity off Karnataka coast across 168 forecast hours.	completed	{"plan_id": "plan_45281231", "workspace": "marine-monitoring", "query": "Analyze near-surface sea temperatures, wave spectra, and ocean current velocity off Karnataka coast across 168 forecast hours.", "normalized_intent": "oceanographic_environmental_monitoring", "target_coordinates": {"latitude": 12.87, "longitude": 74.88, "radius_km": 60.0}, "target_time_horizon": "7-day numerical forecast + historical baseline", "steps": [{"step_id": "step_ocean_research", "agent_id": "ocean_research", "agent_name": "Ocean Intelligence & Research Agent", "phase": "specialist_concurrent", "dependencies": [], "description": "Analyze physical SST, thermal anomalies, currents, and biochemical chlorophyll-a spectra.", "timeout_seconds": 20.0, "max_retries": 2}, {"step_id": "step_marine_hazard", "agent_id": "marine_hazard", "agent_name": "Marine Hazard & Forecast Agent", "phase": "specialist_concurrent", "dependencies": [], "description": "Ingest storm track, Douglas sea state wave spectra, and meteorological alerts.", "timeout_seconds": 20.0, "max_retries": 2}, {"step_id": "step_coastal_risk", "agent_id": "coastal_risk", "agent_name": "Coastal Impact & Risk Agent", "phase": "specialist_dependent", "dependencies": ["step_marine_hazard"], "description": "Evaluate coastal settlement and population exposure using upstream hazard wave and surge parameters.", "timeout_seconds": 20.0, "max_retries": 2}, {"step_id": "step_evidence_verification", "agent_id": "evidence_verification", "agent_name": "Evidence & Scientific Verification Agent", "phase": "scientific_auditor", "dependencies": ["step_ocean_research", "step_marine_hazard", "step_coastal_risk"], "description": "Independently verify scientific claims, cryptographic SHA-256 evidence integrity, units, and detect cross-source conflicts.", "timeout_seconds": 25.0, "max_retries": 1}], "selected_agents": ["coastal_risk", "marine_hazard", "ocean_research", "evidence_verification"], "verification_required": true, "created_at": "2026-10-18T06:49:07.097186Z"}	2026-10-18 12:19:12.438831+05:30	2026-10-18 12:19:12.450128+05:30	2026-10-18 12:19:12.450128+05:30	### Executive Intelligence Synthesis: Marine-Monitoring\n**Query:** Analyze near-surface sea temperatures, wave spectra, and ocean current velocity off Karnataka coast across 168 forecast hours.\n\n#### 1. Operational Assessment & Decision Guidance\n- **Verdict:** 🟢 Operational conditions remain stable off Karnataka coast; near‑surface sea temperature stays around 30.75 °C, wave heights are modest (~0.69 m), and currents are weak (~0.08 m/s) throughout the 168‑hour forecast.\n- **Metrics:** Mean SST 30.75 °C (range 30.6‑31.0 °C), mean significant wave height 0.69 m (median 0.7 m, range 0.54‑0.78 m), mean current velocity 0.08 m/s (peak 0.19 m/s); live buoy at 12.87°N, 74.88°E records SWH 0.68 m, period 9 s.\n- **Action 1:** Continue routine maritime operations at New Mangalore Port, Old Mangalore Port, and Malpe Fishing Harbour—no immediate navigation or port restrictions required.\n- **Action 2:** Maintain regular forecast updates (every 24 h) and issue alerts to the ~765 k coastal residents and the two district hospitals if SST exceeds 31 °C or wave heights approach 1 m.\n\n#### 2. Specialist Observations & Findings\n- **[Finding #1]** Near-surface sea temperature model forecast off Karnataka Coast across 168 forecast hours averages 30.75  °C (range: 30.6 - 31.0  °C across 168 forecast hours). `30.75 °C` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #2]** Wave model forecast off Karnataka Coast across 168 forecast hours indicates mean significant wave height of 0.69 m (median: 0.7 m, range: 0.54 - 0.78 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #3]** Ocean current model forecast off Karnataka Coast across 168 forecast hours indicates mean current velocity of 0.08 m/s (peak: 0.19 m/s). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #4]** Estimated 764,707 residents across 7 coastal settlement(s) (Mangaluru City Corporation, Ullal Coastal Municipality, Surathkal Coastal Settlement, Mulki Coastal Town and 3 others) fall within the hazard footprint. `764,707 people` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #5]** 3 maritime port/harbour facility(ies) intersect the hazard footprint: New Mangalore Port (NMPT), Old Mangalore Port (Bunder), Malpe Fishing Harbour. `3 ports` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #6]** 2 apex healthcare facility(ies) located within the hazard zone: District Wenlock Hospital, Mangaluru, District Government Hospital, Udupi. `2 facilities` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #7]** 1 critical ecological habitat(s) intersect the hazard zone: Netravati-Gurupura Estuarine Mangroves. `1 habitats` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #8]** Live ocean observation at (12.87°N, 74.88°E) records significant wave height of 0.68 m (swell height 0.48 m, wave period 9.0 s, wind wave 0.00 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n\n#### 3. Evidence Integrity & Cryptographic Provenance\n- **Total Evidence Records Ingested:** 15\n- **Primary Data Sources:** Open-Meteo Marine API, OpenStreetMap Contributors, Census of India & KSCZMA\n\n#### 4. Scientific Verification Audit\n- **Audit Status:** `VERIFIED`\n- **Verified Claims:** 8 | **Cross-Source Conflicts:** 0 | **Unverified:** 0\n\n#### 5. Operational Safety & Limitations\n- Surface wind variables are not provided by Open-Meteo Marine API (marine-api.open-meteo.com); requires atmospheric weather API.\n- Chlorophyll observations are unavailable through Open-Meteo Marine API.\n- Open-Meteo values represent numerical model forecasts and estimates rather than direct in-situ buoy/sensor measurements.\n- Proximity or polygon intersection indicates potential exposure, but does not model hydrodynamic inundation depth or wave force without local bathymetry and DEM data.\n- Population figures reflect official Census counts and do not account for real-time transient, tourist, or floating populations.\n- **Official Warning:** *This assessment provides supplementary computational intelligence and does not replace official meteorological advisories from the India Meteorological Department (IMD) or INCOIS.*	{"notes": "Scientific verification run vrun_a78dfee3ee: 8/8 claims matched, 59 checks passed.", "details": [{"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-sst-dc2aa403", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-19f71a63e8"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-wave-92573491", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-19f71a63e8"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "fnd-live-current-643e8346", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["ev-om-live-19f71a63e8"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_dd8174cf_1", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mangaluru", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ullal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_surathkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mulki", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_padubidri", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kaup", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_udupi"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_dd8174cf_2", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_port_nmpt", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_old_mangaluru", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_malpe"]}, {"notes": "All app