arbour, Bhatkal Fishing Port, Honnavar Port & Estuary Terminal, Tadadi Commercial Fishing Port, Belekeri Natural Port, INS Kadamba / Karwar Naval Base (Project Seabird), Karwar Commercial Port (Baithkol). `9 ports` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #3]** 3 apex healthcare facility(ies) located within the hazard zone: District Wenlock Hospital, Mangaluru, District Government Hospital, Udupi, District Civil Hospital, Karwar. `3 facilities` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #4]** 5 critical ecological habitat(s) intersect the hazard zone: Netravati-Gurupura Estuarine Mangroves, St. Mary's Islands Geo-Heritage Site, Sharavati Estuary Mangrove Reserve, Aghanashini Estuary (Ramsar Wetland Site), Kali River Estuary & Mangrove Reserve. `5 habitats` *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n- **[Finding #5]** Live ocean observation at (13.85°N, 74.50°E) records significant wave height of 0.72 m (swell height 0.44 m, wave period 9.6 s, wind wave 0.00 m). *(Status: VERIFIED)*\n\n#### 3. Evidence Integrity & Cryptographic Provenance\n- **Total Evidence Records Ingested:** 37\n- **Primary Data Sources:** Open-Meteo Marine API, OpenStreetMap Contributors, Census of India & KSCZMA\n- **Sample Cryptographic Hash:** `d3a5cd0a81f1354b...` (SHA-256 Verified)\n\n#### 4. Scientific Verification Audit\n- **Audit Status:** `VERIFIED`\n- **Verified Claims:** 5 | **Cross-Source Conflicts:** 0 | **Unverified:** 0\n\n#### 5. Operational Safety & Limitations\n- Shared marine database repository is not configured. Offline sample fixture was not substituted in production mode; current forecast was not substituted for missing historical data.\n- Live marine provider unavailable (). No live numerical model forecast retrieved.\n- Live marine observations were not retrieved from external provider.\n- Proximity or polygon intersection indicates potential exposure, but does not model hydrodynamic inundation depth or wave force without local bathymetry and DEM data.\n- Population figures reflect official Census counts and do not account for real-time transient, tourist, or floating populations.\n- **Official Warning:** *This assessment provides supplementary computational intelligence and does not replace official meteorological advisories from the India Meteorological Department (IMD) or INCOIS.*	{"notes": "Scientific verification run vrun_1a4efb72b9: 5/5 claims matched, 39 checks passed.", "details": [{"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_178340ce_1", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mangaluru", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ullal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_surathkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_udupi", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kundapura", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_padubidri", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kaup", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_mulki", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_brahmavar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_maravanthe", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_byndoor", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_bhatkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_murudeshwar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_honnavar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_kumta", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_gokarna", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_ankola", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_karwar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_settlement_majali"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_178340ce_2", "missing_evidence_ids": [], "reproduced_calculation": null, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["evi_cf_cf_kar_port_nmpt", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_old_mangaluru", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_malpe", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_bhatkal", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_honnavar", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_tadadi", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_belekeri", "evi_cf_cf_kar_infra_kadamba_naval_base", "evi_cf_cf_kar_port_karwar"]}, {"notes": "All applicable deterministic checks passed against verified source evidence.", "state": "verified", "finding_id": "f_coastal_inv_178340ce_3"